        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-870, Fancy Ridged Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe shape and design of RK International's Wavy Contoured Pull with Lines is fantastically retro--a throwback to  days gone by. This Fancy Ridged Cabinet Pull is available with a 3 inch center to center and a 3-1/2 inch center to center in any of 6 finishes. Finish choices include distressed nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and antique english.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-870 Ornate Lined Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-870</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-871</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
